The packed GEMM improves every benchmark, especially the input-projection-heavy shapes. Next I’m looking at the remaining kernels; the `layer_norm` and layout/gate kernels still stream multi-gigabyte tensors, so fusing or changing precision there may matter more than retuning the BMM.
